(6233910, 921546, 38032, '<td valign="top">nice idea. I''d love to see it slightly less exposed at the top but wither way, really an interesting posthumous-ribbon-worthy shot.</td>', 'nice idea. I''d love to see it slightly less exposed at the top but wither way, really an interesting posthumous-ribbon-worthy shot.', '2010-11-26 10:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233911, 921562, 38032, '<td valign="top">great perspective - really interesting and different.</td>', 'great perspective - really interesting and different.', '2010-11-26 10:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233913, 921934, 122444, '<td valign="top">The wine bottle represents the eye-candy, which is the opposite of what everyone expects to ribbon in this challenge, which is the perpect definition of what a posthumous entry should be. The crisp, sharp details and the lighting setup demonstrate your loyalty to your style. People may ask me to take a photo of something according to how they want it to be photographed, and I would do that, but I will not betray my own style. The inverted "you" is what this challenge asks every technically good photographer in the DPC community to be. I give this a 10, and i hope you win.</td>', 'The wine bottle represents the eye-candy, which is the opposite of what everyone expects to ribbon in this challenge, which is the perpect definition of what a posthumous entry should be. The crisp, sharp details and the lighting setup demonstrate your loyalty to your style. People may ask me to take a photo of something according to how they want it to be photographed, and I would do that, but I will not betray my own style. The inverted "you" is what this challenge asks every technically good photographer in the DPC community to be. I give this a 10, and i hope you win.', '2010-11-26 10:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233915, 921247, 122444, '<td valign="top">i know you are trying to achieve a work of art, but i feel dizzy, rather than engaged to the image.</td>', 'i know you are trying to achieve a work of art, but i feel dizzy, rather than engaged to the image.', '2010-11-26 10:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233923, 921961, 122444, '<td valign="top">i believe this art, and photography in one. I give this a ten because it achieves both the artistic rendering of a vision, while at the same time requiring a relatively high technical skills in order to be executed. It is not randomly blurred. It was blurred with precision. And the blurness is not because you lacked the skill and equipment. It is blurred because it was intended to be.</td>', 'i believe this art, and photography in one. I give this a ten because it achieves both the artistic rendering of a vision, while at the same time requiring a relatively high technical skills in order to be executed. It is not randomly blurred. It was blurred with precision. And the blurness is not because you lacked the skill and equipment. It is blurred because it was intended to be.', '2010-11-26 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233924, 921287, 122444, '<td valign="top">be careful when driving and taking photos at the same time. This may be a posthumous ribbon challenge, but it shall be awarded to LIVING photographers.</td>', 'be careful when driving and taking photos at the same time. This may be a posthumous ribbon challenge, but it shall be awarded to LIVING photographers.', '2010-11-26 10:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233927, 921729, 122444, '<td valign="top">They look like the little crosses you put above a grave of a dead photographer who is about to receive a post-humous award.</td>', 'They look like the little crosses you put above a grave of a dead photographer who is about to receive a post-humous award.', '2010-11-26 10:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233931, 921965, 122444, '<td valign="top">None at all, IMHO.</td>', 'None at all, IMHO.', '2010-11-26 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233936, 921513, 54645, '<td valign="top">nothing quite like a poll coming in the middle of the night to fry you while you sleep, strikes me as a demented hallucination. I like it.</td>', 'nothing quite like a poll coming in the middle of the night to fry you while you sleep, strikes me as a demented hallucination. I like it.', '2010-11-26 10:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233937, 921900, 122444, '<td valign="top">He hasn''t touched the water yet, but he seems to be inside the curling waves already.</td>', 'He hasn''t touched the water yet, but he seems to be inside the curling waves already.', '2010-11-26 10:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233942, 921757, 54645, '<td valign="top">wonderful vantage point, lonely stroll through light and dark</td>', 'wonderful vantage point, lonely stroll through light and dark', '2010-11-26 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233944, 921291, 122444, '<td valign="top">So this isn''t wine glass and bottle. This is liquor bottle and a shot glass. Yet still the same -- the usual contents of an eye-candy shot. Wow. The opposite of what people expect to see in this challenge, which is the actual type of image usually appreciated by posthumous. And it is blurred just so it fits the style. Perfect.</td>', 'So this isn''t wine glass and bottle. This is liquor bottle and a shot glass. Yet still the same -- the usual contents of an eye-candy shot. Wow. The opposite of what people expect to see in this challenge, which is the actual type of image usually appreciated by posthumous. And it is blurred just so it fits the style. Perfect.', '2010-11-26 10:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233945, 921939, 54645, '<td valign="top">Very much like the composition, multiple crosses can be seen, and the obvious pseudo-hanging on the cross.</td>', 'Very much like the composition, multiple crosses can be seen, and the obvious pseudo-hanging on the cross.', '2010-11-26 10:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6233947, 921965, 54645, '<td valign="top">Eerie feel, lost in the cold, texture from the movement works well despite some extraneous elements.</td>', 'Eerie feel, lost in the cold, texture from the movement works well despite some extraneous elements.', '2010-11-26 10:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
