(6234357, 920814, 83313, '<td valign="top">I do see animal in there. Maybe it''s a fox carrying a teatray, or a mouse with a cookie.</td>', 'I do see animal in there. Maybe it''s a fox carrying a teatray, or a mouse with a cookie.', '2010-11-26 15:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234360, 921981, 83313, '<td valign="top">An now it''s time for a word from our sponsor...</td>', 'An now it''s time for a word from our sponsor...', '2010-11-26 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234395, 921107, 103142, '<td valign="top">I just left a comment on another photo that it was my favorite of the challenge. Had to bump this one up and say that it''s also my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'I just left a comment on another photo that it was my favorite of the challenge. Had to bump this one up and say that it''s also my favorite of the challenge.', '2010-11-26 16:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234408, 921869, 28882, '<td valign="top">one of my two 10''s in this challenge.  i think it is an amazing photo in it''s own right but because it doesn''t really have the dpc appeal/cliche/whatever i think it would be all over the posthumous thread following a regular challenge.   nice job, i hope you hit it big with this one.</td>', 'one of my two 10''s in this challenge.  i think it is an amazing photo in it''s own right but because it doesn''t really have the dpc appeal/cliche/whatever i think it would be all over the posthumous thread following a regular challenge.   nice job, i hope you hit it big with this one.', '2010-11-26 16:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234410, 921863, 28882, '<td valign="top">there''s so much to like here.  i love the processing for one.  this has to be one of my favorite styles, the muted overall look with light touches of a single color.  but probably the most striking element is the sharp dead looking building crossed by the blurred form of life.    a 9 from me.</td>', 'there''s so much to like here.  i love the processing for one.  this has to be one of my favorite styles, the muted overall look with light touches of a single color.  but probably the most striking element is the sharp dead looking building crossed by the blurred form of life.    a 9 from me.', '2010-11-26 16:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234411, 921983, 28882, '<td valign="top">here is an amazing shot.  so simple.  the blue is a major hit with me and draws me to focus on the manhole covers; a  kind of a static peace amid the chaos of the crowd.  nice work.</td>', 'here is an amazing shot.  so simple.  the blue is a major hit with me and draws me to focus on the manhole covers; a  kind of a static peace amid the chaos of the crowd.  nice work.', '2010-11-26 16:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234412, 921902, 28882, '<td valign="top">i have no clue what this is I''m looking at but i love the great range of b&amp;w tones and the touch of blown light in the lower left corner.  8</td>', 'i have no clue what this is I''m looking at but i love the great range of b&w tones and the touch of blown light in the lower left corner.  8', '2010-11-26 16:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234413, 921686, 28882, '<td valign="top">the tree adds so much to the scale of this amazing shot.  8</td>', 'the tree adds so much to the scale of this amazing shot.  8', '2010-11-26 16:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234444, 921983, 61396, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty grim view of the American dream, I suppose. I like the density and the washed out colors against the bright reflection of of the crosswalk, allowing the shopping bag to stand out. (not voting)</td>', 'That''s a pretty grim view of the American dream, I suppose. I like the density and the washed out colors against the bright reflection of of the crosswalk, allowing the shopping bag to stand out. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 17:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234447, 921107, 76335, '<td valign="top">Ominous swirling energy and a nasty sort of rhythm.</td>', 'Ominous swirling energy and a nasty sort of rhythm.', '2010-11-26 17:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234448, 921422, 76335, '<td valign="top">High key and minimal. I''m guessing this is the moon. Negative style. Good idea. Works well.</td>', 'High key and minimal. I''m guessing this is the moon. Negative style. Good idea. Works well.', '2010-11-26 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234452, 921243, 76335, '<td valign="top">Alleluia! Overlapping crosses as far as the eye can see. A glorious find, beautifully composed.</td>', 'Alleluia! Overlapping crosses as far as the eye can see. A glorious find, beautifully composed.', '2010-11-26 17:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234455, 921964, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the tree against the wood and the sense of depth you added by using this unique pov. (not voting)</td>', 'I like the tree against the wood and the sense of depth you added by using this unique pov. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 17:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234458, 921163, 76335, '<td valign="top">I do like the nervous energy in this. The moment the eye feels like it can latch onto something, there''s a jolt and the eye is loose again.</td>', 'I do like the nervous energy in this. The moment the eye feels like it can latch onto something, there''s a jolt and the eye is loose again.', '2010-11-26 17:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234460, 921404, 76335, '<td valign="top">Simple and understated. I''m not sure the long frame was necessary. I do like the A shape in the clouds -- offers some relief from the horizontal bands.</td>', 'Simple and understated. I''m not sure the long frame was necessary. I do like the A shape in the clouds -- offers some relief from the horizontal bands.', '2010-11-26 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234461, 921323, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not terribly original, but it is nicely composed.</td>', 'Not terribly original, but it is nicely composed.', '2010-11-26 17:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234465, 921962, 76335, '<td valign="top">Feels like a Vintage outtake recycled for this challenge. It''s a good still life, but only the title leaves anything to the imagination.</td>', 'Feels like a Vintage outtake recycled for this challenge. It''s a good still life, but only the title leaves anything to the imagination.', '2010-11-26 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234467, 921921, 61396, '<td valign="top">The lone person seems to have a long way ahead in the cold. The texture you created is almost sensual. (not voting)</td>', 'The lone person seems to have a long way ahead in the cold. The texture you created is almost sensual. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 17:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234468, 921928, 76335, '<td valign="top">A nicely executed still life, but probably better suited to a free study than the madness that is this challenge.</td>', 'A nicely executed still life, but probably better suited to a free study than the madness that is this challenge.', '2010-11-26 17:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234473, 921058, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting and slowly revealing.</td>', 'Interesting and slowly revealing.', '2010-11-26 17:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234475, 921297, 30982, '<td valign="top">Bejeweled and joyous, with a touch of impish playfulness.  Lovely work as ever!  (Comment only.)</td>', 'Bejeweled and joyous, with a touch of impish playfulness.  Lovely work as ever!  (Comment only.)', '2010-11-26 17:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234476, 921873, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  The king is on his throne.</td>', 'Cool shot.  The king is on his throne.', '2010-11-26 17:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234477, 921804, 23484, '<td valign="top">This was taken from a dominating perspective. Nice contrast.</td>', 'This was taken from a dominating perspective. Nice contrast.', '2010-11-26 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234479, 921562, 76335, '<td valign="top">So effectively composed, though I could have done without the heavy contrast lift, most apparent in the background (the distant tree branches). I''ll bet it was perfect right out of the camera.</td>', 'So effectively composed, though I could have done without the heavy contrast lift, most apparent in the background (the distant tree branches). I''ll bet it was perfect right out of the camera.', '2010-11-26 17:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234480, 921243, 30982, '<td valign="top">Slightly disturbing, definitely odd.  Nice find!</td>', 'Slightly disturbing, definitely odd.  Nice find!', '2010-11-26 17:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234481, 921912, 30982, '<td valign="top">An intriguing photo to match your title.</td>', 'An intriguing photo to match your title.', '2010-11-26 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234482, 921434, 23484, '<td valign="top">That''s a really neat capture. Contrasting the old and the new.</td>', 'That''s a really neat capture. Contrasting the old and the new.', '2010-11-26 17:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234483, 920972, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting concept.</td>', 'Very interesting concept.', '2010-11-26 17:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234485, 921919, 30982, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing story we have here, and in such wonderful light, as though they are on a stage and performing just for you.  You seem to have arrived at the height of an aria.</td>', 'What an intriguing story we have here, and in such wonderful light, as though they are on a stage and performing just for you.  You seem to have arrived at the height of an aria.', '2010-11-26 17:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234486, 921869, 23484, '<td valign="top">Cool title and excellent image.  Just follow the light.</td>', 'Cool title and excellent image.  Just follow the light.', '2010-11-26 17:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234487, 921869, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title, and I love the light and processing.  Nicely seen and presented!</td>', 'Wonderful title, and I love the light and processing.  Nicely seen and presented!', '2010-11-26 17:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234488, 921199, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice flow to sync up with the music. I particularly enjoy the third person we cannot see except for her shoes.  The page turner, perhaps?</td>', 'A nice flow to sync up with the music. I particularly enjoy the third person we cannot see except for her shoes.  The page turner, perhaps?', '2010-11-26 17:53:15.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6234489, 921107, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice confluence (is that a word?) of lines, curves, and movement.  Reminds me of a nixterish image.</td>', 'Very nice confluence (is that a word?) of lines, curves, and movement.  Reminds me of a nixterish image.', '2010-11-26 17:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234490, 921181, 30982, '<td valign="top">Disturbing.  And just a wee bit frightening.</td>', 'Disturbing.  And just a wee bit frightening.', '2010-11-26 17:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234492, 921907, 30982, '<td valign="top">The oddness of this makes it quite suitable.  If only there were a toilet in the yard as well...</td>', 'The oddness of this makes it quite suitable.  If only there were a toilet in the yard as well...', '2010-11-26 17:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234498, 921953, 119419, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous, my pick for top 5</td>', 'This is gorgeous, my pick for top 5', '2010-11-26 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234499, 921424, 61396, '<td valign="top">I can see only 3, maybe 4, but I can almost feel the rugged texture, which makes me think this image is in Braille! (not voting)</td>', 'I can see only 3, maybe 4, but I can almost feel the rugged texture, which makes me think this image is in Braille! (not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234501, 921558, 61396, '<td valign="top">The bench is great, but the umbrella at the far side of the river (if that''s what it is) is even greater. (not voting)</td>', 'The bench is great, but the umbrella at the far side of the river (if that''s what it is) is even greater. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234502, 921929, 76335, '<td valign="top">Startling. Outlandish. I think I like it.</td>', 'Startling. Outlandish. I think I like it.', '2010-11-26 18:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234504, 921199, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great that you allowed them enough time to dance for us! (Not voting)</td>', 'Great that you allowed them enough time to dance for us! (Not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234505, 921903, 76335, '<td valign="top">The geometry is good, but the tilt adds a bit of needed kick to keep the eye from becoming too relaxed. Good choice there. I like the textures and shadows too.</td>', 'The geometry is good, but the tilt adds a bit of needed kick to keep the eye from becoming too relaxed. Good choice there. I like the textures and shadows too.', '2010-11-26 18:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234506, 921901, 1024, '<td valign="top">Happiness indeed, and memories being made.</td>', 'Happiness indeed, and memories being made.', '2010-11-26 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234507, 920814, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and a great sense of movement</td>', 'Wonderful colors and a great sense of movement', '2010-11-26 18:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234508, 921546, 76335, '<td valign="top">Proof that even the simplest ideas can still have surprisingly good results. So glad that foreground bird managed to be perfectly still while your shutter was open. He anchors the image.</td>', 'Proof that even the simplest ideas can still have surprisingly good results. So glad that foreground bird managed to be perfectly still while your shutter was open. He anchors the image.', '2010-11-26 18:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234509, 921895, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good study in geometry. I might have preferred black and white, but the interior cool colors play off of the exterior warm colors quite nicely.</td>', 'A good study in geometry. I might have preferred black and white, but the interior cool colors play off of the exterior warm colors quite nicely.', '2010-11-26 18:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234513, 921580, 61396, '<td valign="top">Thanks for allowing some guessing: a God finger coming to lift us for a sinful thought provoked by a passing by girl? It is the "needle" stuck on the left wall that I can''t explain. (not voting)</td>', 'Thanks for allowing some guessing: a God finger coming to lift us for a sinful thought provoked by a passing by girl? It is the "needle" stuck on the left wall that I can''t explain. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234517, 921863, 61396, '<td valign="top">The passerby movement accentuate the slow disintegration of the building and creates a sense of depth. The green is gorgeous. (not voting)</td>', 'The passerby movement accentuate the slow disintegration of the building and creates a sense of depth. The green is gorgeous. (not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234520, 921804, 61396, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of my childhood (though my parents didn''t use a camera in such cases) (not voting)</td>', 'Reminds me of my childhood (though my parents didn''t use a camera in such cases) (not voting)', '2010-11-26 18:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234522, 921362, 120666, '<td valign="top">I think this would have done very well in "Clouds"</td>', 'I think this would have done very well in "Clouds"', '2010-11-26 18:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234551, 921976, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has a wonderful combination of mystery, flow, brushstrokes, color, conversation.  I quite love it.</td>', 'This has a wonderful combination of mystery, flow, brushstrokes, color, conversation.  I quite love it.', '2010-11-26 19:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234554, 921974, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great catch!  Perfect placement of all your characters, love how the dog is nearly hidden by the brush, and that beam of light is icing on the cake.</td>', 'Great catch!  Perfect placement of all your characters, love how the dog is nearly hidden by the brush, and that beam of light is icing on the cake.', '2010-11-26 19:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234555, 921834, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh, break my heart.  :~(  How beautiful.  Truly.</td>', 'Oh, break my heart.  :~(  How beautiful.  Truly.', '2010-11-26 19:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234556, 921804, 30982, '<td valign="top">The perspective here is amazing - the face on the floor so tiny!  Lots of energy with just a touch of something akin to but not quite fear.</td>', 'The perspective here is amazing - the face on the floor so tiny!  Lots of energy with just a touch of something akin to but not quite fear.', '2010-11-26 19:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234557, 921577, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great setting, good title.</td>', 'Great setting, good title.', '2010-11-26 19:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234560, 921408, 121073, '<td valign="top">5</td>', '5', '2010-11-26 19:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234607, 921973, 76335, '<td valign="top">An okay snap of your dog, but not much more.</td>', 'An okay snap of your dog, but not much more.', '2010-11-26 20:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234608, 921362, 76335, '<td valign="top">Such an excellent composition. The V shape seems fitting for obvious reasons, not to mention the way they frame the two birds in flight. The clouds add drama. Not crazy about the vignette, but maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'Such an excellent composition. The V shape seems fitting for obvious reasons, not to mention the way they frame the two birds in flight. The clouds add drama. Not crazy about the vignette, but maybe that''s just me.', '2010-11-26 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234620, 921934, 68947, '<td valign="top">I HAVE to find out how you did this!!!! LOL 10!!</td>', 'I HAVE to find out how you did this!!!! LOL 10!!', '2010-11-26 21:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234624, 921982, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOVE the processing on this one!!!  Fantastic job!!! 9</td>', 'LOVE the processing on this one!!!  Fantastic job!!! 9', '2010-11-26 21:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234628, 921930, 30982, '<td valign="top">This strikes an immediate mood - he''s so intent.  And yet there''s no one around him.  You want to think there''s a crowd over here, from your perspective, appreciating his work, but you can just as easily see him playing with no one listening.  I do like this.</td>', 'This strikes an immediate mood - he''s so intent.  And yet there''s no one around him.  You want to think there''s a crowd over here, from your perspective, appreciating his work, but you can just as easily see him playing with no one listening.  I do like this.', '2010-11-26 21:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234630, 920814, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well titled.  There''s a warmth and energy here, and an intriguing creature or two hiding in the lines.</td>', 'Well titled.  There''s a warmth and energy here, and an intriguing creature or two hiding in the lines.', '2010-11-26 21:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234631, 921836, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much my kind of shot.  The shadow more real than the creature that cast it.</td>', 'Very much my kind of shot.  The shadow more real than the creature that cast it.', '2010-11-26 21:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234632, 920914, 30982, '<td valign="top">An essence.  A view from behind the glass.  Really really well done.</td>', 'An essence.  A view from behind the glass.  Really really well done.', '2010-11-26 21:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234633, 921863, 30982, '<td valign="top">The ghost is almost an afterthought.  The break in the curtains gets my attention first and I can see a pair of eyes there watching the ghost as he passes.</td>', 'The ghost is almost an afterthought.  The break in the curtains gets my attention first and I can see a pair of eyes there watching the ghost as he passes.', '2010-11-26 21:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234634, 921834, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok....tears galore right now.  I can''t even see to type this in.  (and, I don''t even know WHY I came in here tonight as I haven''t been here since the summer!)<br/> <br/>"My heart and the love in it is strong but, my body is giving out.  I''ve lived a good and long life and I''ve been loved greatly and I have given love back in return.  I''ve played and eaten the best and, I''ve sampled the garbage from the kitchen and front porch. I''ve had the pleasure of having rolled and laid with 3 babes who have grown into fine young men.  I''ve been given all that I''ve ever needed, wanted and more and I''ve given my all back to those who have shown me a beautiful life.  I am loved.<br/> <br/>I am not gone. I am in your hearts and minds and will be beside you, watching over you all.  Be happy for me....for I was tired but, I will always be with you.  You''ll feel me with you wherever you are for I am eternal and my love is eternal just as I know that your love is eternal for me.   You knew what I needed most and you gave that to me.  Just as for every other living being...it was just my time to take a rest. I thank you for loving me so much to be so unselfish to have let me be free to go and take that rest."  <br/> <br/>Eyes speak volumes and you''ve captured that in this shot.  10</td>', 'Ok....tears galore right now.  I can''t even see to type this in.  (and, I don''t even know WHY I came in here tonight as I haven''t been here since the summer!) "My heart and the love in it is strong but, my body is giving out.  I''ve lived a good and long life and I''ve been loved greatly and I have given love back in return.  I''ve played and eaten the best and, I''ve sampled the garbage from the kitchen and front porch. I''ve had the pleasure of having rolled and laid with 3 babes who have grown into fine young men.  I''ve been given all that I''ve ever needed, wanted and more and I''ve given my all back to those who have shown me a beautiful life.  I am loved. I am not gone. I am in your hearts and minds and will be beside you, watching over you all.  Be happy for me....for I was tired but, I will always be with you.  You''ll feel me with you wherever you are for I am eternal and my love is eternal just as I know that your love is eternal for me.   You knew what I needed most and you gave that to me.  Just as for every other living being...it was just my time to take a rest. I thank you for loving me so much to be so unselfish to have let me be free to go and take that rest."   Eyes speak volumes and you''ve captured that in this shot.  10', '2010-11-26 21:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234645, 921744, 30982, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.  What an intrepid little guy - sun glinting off his head, ready to take on the world!</td>', 'Made me smile.  What an intrepid little guy - sun glinting off his head, ready to take on the world!', '2010-11-26 21:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234646, 921434, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and captured - what a great place to shoot!</td>', 'Very well seen and captured - what a great place to shoot!', '2010-11-26 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234647, 921981, 30982, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to get it.</td>', 'Took me a minute to get it.', '2010-11-26 21:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234648, 921757, 30982, '<td valign="top">I can hear the echo of the footsteps.</td>', 'I can hear the echo of the footsteps.', '2010-11-26 21:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234649, 921580, 30982, '<td valign="top">Disturbing and well done!</td>', 'Disturbing and well done!', '2010-11-26 21:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234650, 921618, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely abstractish sort of thing.  A very nice way to interpret the challenge with a colorful, focused, sharp photograph.</td>', 'A lovely abstractish sort of thing.  A very nice way to interpret the challenge with a colorful, focused, sharp photograph.', '2010-11-26 21:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234671, 921910, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully woven warmth!</td>', 'Wonderfully woven warmth!', '2010-11-26 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234673, 921163, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the question marks!</td>', 'I love the question marks!', '2010-11-26 21:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234675, 921895, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like the folks framed in the upper pane.  One gets a sense of someone who never ventures outside - only views a world compartmentalized by the panes of the window.</td>', 'Quite like the folks framed in the upper pane.  One gets a sense of someone who never ventures outside - only views a world compartmentalized by the panes of the window.', '2010-11-26 21:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234681, 921439, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  It has a very portentous, Stephen King feel about it.  Like something is going to happen in the woods that will change their lives forever.</td>', 'I like this very much.  It has a very portentous, Stephen King feel about it.  Like something is going to happen in the woods that will change their lives forever.', '2010-11-26 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234689, 920851, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has a feel to it that I just love.  Gritty.  Earthy.</td>', 'This has a feel to it that I just love.  Gritty.  Earthy.', '2010-11-26 21:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234691, 921964, 15711, '<td valign="top">Wow talk about a setting for a thriller.  I love the wide angle.  This is outstanding and I think worthy of more than a posthumous ribbon, although getting one is really a notch in one''s gun.</td>', 'Wow talk about a setting for a thriller.  I love the wide angle.  This is outstanding and I think worthy of more than a posthumous ribbon, although getting one is really a notch in one''s gun.', '2010-11-26 21:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234692, 921974, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh wow - the juxtaposition between the bird and the girl.  I love it.</td>', 'Oh wow - the juxtaposition between the bird and the girl.  I love it.', '2010-11-26 21:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6234693, 921362, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Love the title.</td>', 'Love it.  Love the title.', '2010-11-26 21:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
