(6235164, 921562, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very lovely! The close detail is very good with a bit of OOF on the tree tops. I feel a bit of a dreamy feeling.</td>', 'Very lovely! The close detail is very good with a bit of OOF on the tree tops. I feel a bit of a dreamy feeling.', '2010-11-27 13:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6235165, 921329, 112739, '<td valign="top">This makes for an interesting image for sure. Have no idea what it is but I''m thinking some sort of statue in a park somewhere maybe. I like everything except the hallows.</td>', 'This makes for an interesting image for sure. Have no idea what it is but I''m thinking some sort of statue in a park somewhere maybe. I like everything except the hallows.', '2010-11-27 13:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6235167, 921863, 112739, '<td valign="top">This caught my eye as I was browsing the first time without voting. Love the luminance and motion. The edges of the image are just a bit too dark for me  but they don''t make me vote lower. All in all an excellent work.</td>', 'This caught my eye as I was browsing the first time without voting. Love the luminance and motion. The edges of the image are just a bit too dark for me  but they don''t make me vote lower. All in all an excellent work.', '2010-11-27 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
