(6235169, 921804, 112739, '<td valign="top">This image sends some very disturbing feelings to me. I think it was designed to do that, but not sure how to feel about it.</td>', 'This image sends some very disturbing feelings to me. I think it was designed to do that, but not sure how to feel about it.', '2010-11-27 14:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
