(6235266, 921976, 53814, '<td valign="top">A poem, a painting, and a story. Plus, a simple title that puts it over the top.<br/>This feels very much like a Les pinhole photo.  <br/>My favorite of this challenge.</td>', 'A poem, a painting, and a story. Plus, a simple title that puts it over the top.This feels very much like a Les pinhole photo.  My favorite of this challenge.', '2010-11-27 16:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6235270, 921408, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Very clever idea. The only thing I''d change is to introduce more negative space. It''s a bit too confined. I like the square crop, as it makes the most of the space allotment, but I''d like your angel to be set back a bit. Not sure why I feel the need to share personal preferences, as you likely don''t care, but either way it''s a cool shot.</td>', 'Great shot. Very clever idea. The only thing I''d change is to introduce more negative space. It''s a bit too confined. I like the square crop, as it makes the most of the space allotment, but I''d like your angel to be set back a bit. Not sure why I feel the need to share personal preferences, as you likely don''t care, but either way it''s a cool shot.', '2010-11-27 16:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6235272, 921876, 86447, '<td valign="top">Very Posthumousy.  ;)    (not voting)</td>', 'Very Posthumousy.  ;)    (not voting)', '2010-11-27 16:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
