(6235925, 921903, 1024, '<td valign="top">Just absolutely beautiful.<br/> <br/>Edited to add:  I keep coming back to this.  The use of leading diagonal lines is a powerful tool and you have used it to great advantage.</td>', 'Just absolutely beautiful. Edited to add:  I keep coming back to this.  The use of leading diagonal lines is a powerful tool and you have used it to great advantage.', '2010-11-28 10:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
