(6235936, 921362, 22689, '<td valign="top">No doubt, one of my favorite : great sky with nice textured clouds, the rows of birds add an interesting symetry and to cap it all the flying birds !!!</td>', 'No doubt, one of my favorite : great sky with nice textured clouds, the rows of birds add an interesting symetry and to cap it all the flying birds !!!', '2010-11-28 11:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
