(6236979, 921034, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great title, and a nice explosion (rupture?) of color. Great radiating lines. Well done.</td>', 'Great title, and a nice explosion (rupture?) of color. Great radiating lines. Well done.', '2010-11-29 06:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
