(6237001, 921439, 40391, '<td valign="top">Great location and lighting.  I like the fact everyone''s walking away from the shot.  I''m guessing this was taken with a lens baby.  Nice effect.</td>', 'Great location and lighting.  I like the fact everyone''s walking away from the shot.  I''m guessing this was taken with a lens baby.  Nice effect.', '2010-11-29 06:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
