(6237036, 921512, 40391, '<td valign="top">Besides the fact that I''m male and find this seductive, the lighting and composition is great making this an excellent image.</td>', 'Besides the fact that I''m male and find this seductive, the lighting and composition is great making this an excellent image.', '2010-11-29 07:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
