(6237355, 921580, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo and excellent title. Major story here with ominous mood. Awesome.</td>', 'Wonderful photo and excellent title. Major story here with ominous mood. Awesome.', '2010-11-29 12:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237356, 921034, 108580, '<td valign="top">I like the play on words. Simply Awful. I agree some of the work that is chosen by OTHERS for the "Posthumous" awards are rather awful. But his choices contain an embodiment of odd and unusual, as this is.</td>', 'I like the play on words. Simply Awful. I agree some of the work that is chosen by OTHERS for the "Posthumous" awards are rather awful. But his choices contain an embodiment of odd and unusual, as this is.', '2010-11-29 12:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237357, 921577, 108580, '<td valign="top">Clever play on words. I''m sure each one can tell a story. I think this embodies the spirit of a Posthumous Award.</td>', 'Clever play on words. I''m sure each one can tell a story. I think this embodies the spirit of a Posthumous Award.', '2010-11-29 12:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237361, 921577, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words with the title. Cool scene, with three distinct stories playing out that are wide open to the imagination. Excellent capture. Very creative and interesting. Well done.</td>', 'Nice play on words with the title. Cool scene, with three distinct stories playing out that are wide open to the imagination. Excellent capture. Very creative and interesting. Well done.', '2010-11-29 12:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237376, 921939, 108069, '<td valign="top">This is amazing. Focus is truly dream-like, the natural framing is exactly what I love. Composition is with relatively straight vertical and horizontal lines, yet it''s divided well and presents a rather unnerving and unconventional scene. The title of course is great, and the subject reinforces this by clutching his arms to himself, afraid to stretch them out for fear of what may happen. A metaphor for the challenge? Outstanding photo.</td>', 'This is amazing. Focus is truly dream-like, the natural framing is exactly what I love. Composition is with relatively straight vertical and horizontal lines, yet it''s divided well and presents a rather unnerving and unconventional scene. The title of course is great, and the subject reinforces this by clutching his arms to himself, afraid to stretch them out for fear of what may happen. A metaphor for the challenge? Outstanding photo.', '2010-11-29 12:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
