(6237502, 921686, 122591, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite this challenge. Great job spotting this and then framing it so beautifully. I think maybe I''d prefer a less specific title, but I''m not reducing the score due to that. 9</td>', 'This is my favorite this challenge. Great job spotting this and then framing it so beautifully. I think maybe I''d prefer a less specific title, but I''m not reducing the score due to that. 9', '2010-11-29 14:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
