(6237504, 921958, 122591, '<td valign="top">Great motive! I think the colors may be a bit distracting here, for me this would look better in B&amp;W. Still, great picture! 8</td>', 'Great motive! I think the colors may be a bit distracting here, for me this would look better in B&W. Still, great picture! 8', '2010-11-29 14:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
