(6237516, 921913, 108069, '<td valign="top">Super shot. Great high key style with excellent focus, lines and some nice mystery. Well done.</td>', 'Super shot. Great high key style with excellent focus, lines and some nice mystery. Well done.', '2010-11-29 14:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237519, 921974, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The dog wants off the leash to get at the egret in the sun''s spotlight. Great title and great capture. Nice tones. Well done.</td>', 'Great shot. The dog wants off the leash to get at the egret in the sun''s spotlight. Great title and great capture. Nice tones. Well done.', '2010-11-29 14:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237521, 921121, 108069, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo. The focal point is so sharp it''s as if the rest of the scene is a dream. Great mood and beautiful scene. Excellent.</td>', 'Awesome photo. The focal point is so sharp it''s as if the rest of the scene is a dream. Great mood and beautiful scene. Excellent.', '2010-11-29 14:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237525, 921719, 108069, '<td valign="top">This truly is an explosion of color that is a bit jarring in the thumbnail, but viewed at full size the wonderful details emerge, like the texture of the grass, the gradient tones in the sky. Maybe a bit bright, but a very interesting image.</td>', 'This truly is an explosion of color that is a bit jarring in the thumbnail, but viewed at full size the wonderful details emerge, like the texture of the grass, the gradient tones in the sky. Maybe a bit bright, but a very interesting image.', '2010-11-29 14:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237527, 921329, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great tones and texture. Nice contrast. Truly a unique photo. Nice composition and great title. Like it a lot.</td>', 'Great tones and texture. Nice contrast. Truly a unique photo. Nice composition and great title. Like it a lot.', '2010-11-29 14:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237528, 921798, 108069, '<td valign="top">This has a negative mash-up look to it and it works well. Great contrast and tones.</td>', 'This has a negative mash-up look to it and it works well. Great contrast and tones.', '2010-11-29 14:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237540, 921544, 108069, '<td valign="top">I love the capture of her(?) on one paw, as though she''s suspended. Certainly interesting, also with the reflection. I would have spun the title to point out the more interesting aspects of the shot, instead of just the name of the dog (if that''s what it is). Regardless it''s a fun capture and quite interesting.</td>', 'I love the capture of her(?) on one paw, as though she''s suspended. Certainly interesting, also with the reflection. I would have spun the title to point out the more interesting aspects of the shot, instead of just the name of the dog (if that''s what it is). Regardless it''s a fun capture and quite interesting.', '2010-11-29 14:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237543, 921404, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and ominous colors here. Even the stalks look fierce. Very nice.</td>', 'Great contrast and ominous colors here. Even the stalks look fierce. Very nice.', '2010-11-29 14:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237544, 921512, 108069, '<td valign="top">Extremely well done. Mysterious and hypnotic.</td>', 'Extremely well done. Mysterious and hypnotic.', '2010-11-29 15:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237548, 921243, 108069, '<td valign="top">Ah, Lithuania! I''ve been there, and this is a nice perspective. I found it difficult to figure out what to do with my camera there, as there''s really a lot going on and I found composing tough, but this is a very nice capture.</td>', 'Ah, Lithuania! I''ve been there, and this is a nice perspective. I found it difficult to figure out what to do with my camera there, as there''s really a lot going on and I found composing tough, but this is a very nice capture.', '2010-11-29 15:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237562, 921958, 38930, '<td valign="top">Ha, great title!</td>', 'Ha, great title!', '2010-11-29 15:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237566, 920816, 50864, '<td valign="top">I cam see this framed and hanging in a gallery. Very nice.</td>', 'I cam see this framed and hanging in a gallery. Very nice.', '2010-11-29 15:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237567, 921804, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great angle.  Not a view one usually sees. Beautiful processing. Bumping</td>', 'Great angle.  Not a view one usually sees. Beautiful processing. Bumping', '2010-11-29 15:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237570, 921577, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great light and shadows.  I like that all if the faces are in the dark. Nice capture.</td>', 'Great light and shadows.  I like that all if the faces are in the dark. Nice capture.', '2010-11-29 15:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237572, 921798, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  is the tree sentient? Looks like it could be. I love the combination of detail and blur of the tree and very nice ghost grass.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  is the tree sentient? Looks like it could be. I love the combination of detail and blur of the tree and very nice ghost grass.', '2010-11-29 15:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237573, 921982, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here and I love the colors of the sky, but I am not sure that I am a big fan of the post processing. She looks a bit out of the element with the halo effect around her,  almost like she was photoshopped in (not saying that she was, just that it makes her look set apart and different from the rest of the shot). To each his own, but I am just not a big fan of it.</td>', 'I really like the idea here and I love the colors of the sky, but I am not sure that I am a big fan of the post processing. She looks a bit out of the element with the halo effect around her,  almost like she was photoshopped in (not saying that she was, just that it makes her look set apart and different from the rest of the shot). To each his own, but I am just not a big fan of it.', '2010-11-29 15:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237574, 920851, 50864, '<td valign="top">That is a crime scene for sure. Perfect title for this well composed shot.</td>', 'That is a crime scene for sure. Perfect title for this well composed shot.', '2010-11-29 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237579, 921010, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like this. It has a lonely feel.</td>', 'I like this. It has a lonely feel.', '2010-11-29 15:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237580, 921930, 50864, '<td valign="top">Has me wondering about the person and the room. It doesn''t look like a bar. Maybe a storage room. Does he practice here? Interesting capture.</td>', 'Has me wondering about the person and the room. It doesn''t look like a bar. Maybe a storage room. Does he practice here? Interesting capture.', '2010-11-29 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237582, 921809, 50864, '<td valign="top">I like all of the empty space and the horizontal shadow. Nice capture.</td>', 'I like all of the empty space and the horizontal shadow. Nice capture.', '2010-11-29 15:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237586, 921618, 70484, '<td valign="top">I''m probably pretty thick, but I don''t know what the title means for this photo. I also don''t know what this photo is, but I do know that I love it!!! The colors are perfect and the composition is so balanced. The swirl towards the left creates a beautiful movement and the geometric shapes for the colors creates the perfect combination. I think it is beautiful!!! One of my favs!</td>', 'I''m probably pretty thick, but I don''t know what the title means for this photo. I also don''t know what this photo is, but I do know that I love it!!! The colors are perfect and the composition is so balanced. The swirl towards the left creates a beautiful movement and the geometric shapes for the colors creates the perfect combination. I think it is beautiful!!! One of my favs!', '2010-11-29 15:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237590, 920887, 70484, '<td valign="top">I love that you did this in B&amp;W. I don''t know that I have ever seen a hummer without color, but I love it. The form is enhanced and it is beautiful in it''s simplicity! I don''t know that I like the white border around it, but the picture itself is what I scored and it is definitely in my favorites.</td>', 'I love that you did this in B&W. I don''t know that I have ever seen a hummer without color, but I love it. The form is enhanced and it is beautiful in it''s simplicity! I don''t know that I like the white border around it, but the picture itself is what I scored and it is definitely in my favorites.', '2010-11-29 15:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237594, 921901, 70484, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect!!! There is so much feeling here, I just love it!</td>', 'Absolutely perfect!!! There is so much feeling here, I just love it!', '2010-11-29 16:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237597, 921862, 70484, '<td valign="top">I really like this capture. I love the movement of the water against the calm of the person, but at the same time there is a story and one could almost feel that the storm and churning water could be inside that apparently calm person. It''s almost as if the elements are reflecting what is inside. Beautiful!</td>', 'I really like this capture. I love the movement of the water against the calm of the person, but at the same time there is a story and one could almost feel that the storm and churning water could be inside that apparently calm person. It''s almost as if the elements are reflecting what is inside. Beautiful!', '2010-11-29 16:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237599, 921919, 54645, '<td valign="top">This is an image full of noise, I love it.</td>', 'This is an image full of noise, I love it.', '2010-11-29 16:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237600, 921974, 54645, '<td valign="top">Actually, I find this very much connected. Splendid image.</td>', 'Actually, I find this very much connected. Splendid image.', '2010-11-29 16:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237604, 921865, 57447, '<td valign="top">This would do well in a free study...nice.</td>', 'This would do well in a free study...nice.', '2010-11-29 16:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237605, 921889, 57447, '<td valign="top">Could be worthy of a Posthumous ribbon.</td>', 'Could be worthy of a Posthumous ribbon.', '2010-11-29 16:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237608, 921010, 57447, '<td valign="top">Your title fits your entry quite well!</td>', 'Your title fits your entry quite well!', '2010-11-29 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237609, 921871, 57447, '<td valign="top">Unique...I don''t quite have the skills to comment like Posthumous but I like your idea.</td>', 'Unique...I don''t quite have the skills to comment like Posthumous but I like your idea.', '2010-11-29 16:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237610, 920887, 57447, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done.</td>', 'Beautifully done.', '2010-11-29 16:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237632, 921934, 101702, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this shot, and no doubt it will ribbon. Not sure it really meets the challenge though as Posthumous Ribbons are usually saved for those images that are "overlooked" in the voting. I can''t ever imagine that this would be overlooked by voters. In a normal challenge I would unfalteringly give this a 10. Wonderfully creative as usual. In this challenge though I''m going to have to knock a few points off. I still believe this will be on the front page though.</td>', 'Absolutely love this shot, and no doubt it will ribbon. Not sure it really meets the challenge though as Posthumous Ribbons are usually saved for those images that are "overlooked" in the voting. I can''t ever imagine that this would be overlooked by voters. In a normal challenge I would unfalteringly give this a 10. Wonderfully creative as usual. In this challenge though I''m going to have to knock a few points off. I still believe this will be on the front page though.', '2010-11-29 17:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237641, 921783, 76335, '<td valign="top">An interesting sort of still life. I thought it might be negative, but I''m really not sure. Doesn''t matter, of course.</td>', 'An interesting sort of still life. I thought it might be negative, but I''m really not sure. Doesn''t matter, of course.', '2010-11-29 17:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237644, 921869, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''ve been struggling with this. Seems to be begging for a shadowy rider, but that could look very cliche. I do like that you avoided perfect symmetry.</td>', 'I''ve been struggling with this. Seems to be begging for a shadowy rider, but that could look very cliche. I do like that you avoided perfect symmetry.', '2010-11-29 17:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237651, 921780, 76335, '<td valign="top">Oh, Annie, I''ve tried for days to figure out your secret, but to no avail.</td>', 'Oh, Annie, I''ve tried for days to figure out your secret, but to no avail.', '2010-11-29 17:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237658, 921862, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose. Seems all he''s missing is maybe a tophat.</td>', 'Interesting pose. Seems all he''s missing is maybe a tophat.', '2010-11-29 17:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237669, 921863, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like that the house doesn''t fit squarely or snugly in the frame. Adds to the feeling of decay and collapse. The ghost-like figure also works to that effect.</td>', 'I like that the house doesn''t fit squarely or snugly in the frame. Adds to the feeling of decay and collapse. The ghost-like figure also works to that effect.', '2010-11-29 17:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237708, 921722, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little too careless for me.</td>', 'A little too careless for me.', '2010-11-29 17:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237777, 921729, 61396, '<td valign="top">Finding God in the mundane? (not voting)</td>', 'Finding God in the mundane? (not voting)', '2010-11-29 17:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237779, 921771, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good idea, although a construction site probably doesn''t make the most interesting fragmented sort of composition.</td>', 'A good idea, although a construction site probably doesn''t make the most interesting fragmented sort of composition.', '2010-11-29 17:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237780, 921982, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting a feeling of solitude at all. The heavyhanded processing and her carefree pose both make me think she''s daintily exploring a magical wonderland.</td>', 'I''m not getting a feeling of solitude at all. The heavyhanded processing and her carefree pose both make me think she''s daintily exploring a magical wonderland.', '2010-11-29 17:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237782, 921434, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is pretty funny. I''ll appreciate it more if I know that it''s candid. Giving you the benefit of the doubt as I score it...</td>', 'This is pretty funny. I''ll appreciate it more if I know that it''s candid. Giving you the benefit of the doubt as I score it...', '2010-11-29 17:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237785, 921771, 61396, '<td valign="top">Putting the pieces back together to restore the original scene is a fun task. Thanks! (not voting)</td>', 'Putting the pieces back together to restore the original scene is a fun task. Thanks! (not voting)', '2010-11-29 17:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237789, 920816, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m still looking for her. I like abstract, but I''m having trouble finding a way in here.</td>', 'I''m still looking for her. I like abstract, but I''m having trouble finding a way in here.', '2010-11-29 18:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237790, 921925, 76335, '<td valign="top">Subtle, but funny the more time you spend with it.</td>', 'Subtle, but funny the more time you spend with it.', '2010-11-29 18:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237791, 921951, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good riddance. Who can argue with this?</td>', 'Good riddance. Who can argue with this?', '2010-11-29 18:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237792, 921439, 76335, '<td valign="top">Cute. Would like to see some faces though.</td>', 'Cute. Would like to see some faces though.', '2010-11-29 18:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237794, 921960, 76335, '<td valign="top">A beautiful portrait of earth, climate, atmosphere.</td>', 'A beautiful portrait of earth, climate, atmosphere.', '2010-11-29 18:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
