(6237822, 920814, 61396, '<td valign="top">Pretty scary stuff, with the anteater serving as a comic relief. I like the impetus of the paintbrush strokes. (not voting)</td>', 'Pretty scary stuff, with the anteater serving as a comic relief. I like the impetus of the paintbrush strokes. (not voting)', '2010-11-29 18:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237829, 921984, 76335, '<td valign="top">Sorry -- this just looks like a vintage outtake to me. It''s nice enough, but inconsistent with the likes of things I see getting Posthumous ribbons.</td>', 'Sorry -- this just looks like a vintage outtake to me. It''s nice enough, but inconsistent with the likes of things I see getting Posthumous ribbons.', '2010-11-29 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237833, 921910, 86447, '<td valign="top">A nicely balanced abstract!    I actually like it.  Odd for me...  *grin*   (not voting)</td>', 'A nicely balanced abstract!    I actually like it.  Odd for me...  *grin*   (not voting)', '2010-11-29 18:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237834, 921809, 86447, '<td valign="top">Bird butt above the line... I like this.   Seriously.   It''s just quirky enough to do well for you, I hope.  (not voting)</td>', 'Bird butt above the line... I like this.   Seriously.   It''s just quirky enough to do well for you, I hope.  (not voting)', '2010-11-29 18:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237835, 921199, 76335, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of blur -- I only wish the violin weren''t obscuring the pianist''s face.</td>', 'Interesting use of blur -- I only wish the violin weren''t obscuring the pianist''s face.', '2010-11-29 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237836, 921886, 76335, '<td valign="top">Confidently nonchalant. A fun portrait.</td>', 'Confidently nonchalant. A fun portrait.', '2010-11-29 18:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237838, 921961, 5112, '<td valign="top">That rotation looks so perfect, almost too perfect maybe.  I imagine you putting the lens against a window and spinning it while holding down the shutter button, or something like that.  So I imagine looking through a window, or a bottle, at the sunset.  It''s like a bit of a drunken photo, but not drunk enough to get things wobbly.  The colours are pretty.  It doesn''t give me much of a feeling of devouring though, it''s too cheerful for that.</td>', 'That rotation looks so perfect, almost too perfect maybe.  I imagine you putting the lens against a window and spinning it while holding down the shutter button, or something like that.  So I imagine looking through a window, or a bottle, at the sunset.  It''s like a bit of a drunken photo, but not drunk enough to get things wobbly.  The colours are pretty.  It doesn''t give me much of a feeling of devouring though, it''s too cheerful for that.', '2010-11-29 18:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6237839, 921719, 76335, '<td valign="top">Processing is way over the top for me. I am curious to know where this was taken though.</td>', 'Processing is way over the top for me. I am curious to know where this was taken though.', '2010-11-29 18:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
