(6237918, 921873, 76335, '<td valign="top">Having trouble with this one. I think with a little more work, the blur could have been rendered more artistically, offering something with more ambiguity. But as it stands it just looks blurred -- accidentally or carelessly. I score you on where it was going. Six.</td>', 'Having trouble with this one. I think with a little more work, the blur could have been rendered more artistically, offering something with more ambiguity. But as it stands it just looks blurred -- accidentally or carelessly. I score you on where it was going. Six.', '2010-11-29 20:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
