(6239828, 921884, 30364, '<td valign="top">A person in a wheelchair covered in a blanket?   At 6:45 am?  Surely not?  But I suppose I must take your word for it.  Still ... how would a wheelchair-bound person drape a blanket over themselves in this way?  With great difficulty, as in pretty much everything else, I suppose.</td>', 'A person in a wheelchair covered in a blanket?   At 6:45 am?  Surely not?  But I suppose I must take your word for it.  Still ... how would a wheelchair-bound person drape a blanket over themselves in this way?  With great difficulty, as in pretty much everything else, I suppose.', '2010-12-01 05:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
