(6240136, 921780, 50864, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this multiple times and like it a little more each time.  Not sure what else to say other than I have it up to 8 now and may still bump it up higher. I''m looking forward to how others comment on this.</td>', 'I have looked at this multiple times and like it a little more each time.  Not sure what else to say other than I have it up to 8 now and may still bump it up higher. I''m looking forward to how others comment on this.', '2010-12-01 10:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
