(6240146, 921932, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like the picture for its tonal and graphic presence; all those great blocks of darkness and light, all those slightly spherical lines of perspective, but I think it would be far better without the girl in it.  Also more appropriate to the book title, which I assume must have been itself fairly lightly chosen.</td>', 'I like the picture for its tonal and graphic presence; all those great blocks of darkness and light, all those slightly spherical lines of perspective, but I think it would be far better without the girl in it.  Also more appropriate to the book title, which I assume must have been itself fairly lightly chosen.', '2010-12-01 10:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240147, 921424, 30364, '<td valign="top">First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.  I had a quandary infinitum.  Resolved in your favour. 8.</td>', 'First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.  I had a quandary infinitum.  Resolved in your favour. 8.', '2010-12-01 10:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
