(6240149, 921953, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully self-contained and self-assured photograph.  If she were still active here I''d have attributed this one to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=35804" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">RKT</a>.  Or if not her then <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50641" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">skewsme</a>.  Beacons in the darkness, those two.  So well done &amp; thank you!</td>', 'This is a beautifully self-contained and self-assured photograph.  If she were still active here I''d have attributed this one to  RKT.  Or if not her then  skewsme.  Beacons in the darkness, those two.  So well done & thank you!', '2010-12-01 10:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240150, 921871, 30364, '<td valign="top">Absurd photograph.  I love that.  8.  Thank you!</td>', 'Absurd photograph.  I love that.  8.  Thank you!', '2010-12-01 10:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240155, 920814, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is difficult.  I''m either slightly ambivalent or wildly enthusiastic about it.  I''ll go with wildly enthusiastic I think.  Thank you.  Second longer look ... I''m still happy with enthusiastic.  A contemporary cave painting.  Love that mad wolf thing.  Thanks again.</td>', 'This is difficult.  I''m either slightly ambivalent or wildly enthusiastic about it.  I''ll go with wildly enthusiastic I think.  Thank you.  Second longer look ... I''m still happy with enthusiastic.  A contemporary cave painting.  Love that mad wolf thing.  Thanks again.', '2010-12-01 10:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240156, 920956, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s packed with interest and entertainment.  Very nice monotone conversion too.  But my greatest pleasure came from realising that none of the five figures is visually or physically interacting with any other.  It''s as if they are each quite unaware of the presence of all the others.  It''s odd and weirdly pleasing that five people engaged on a common task would be arrayed in this disconnected way in a photograph. 8.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s packed with interest and entertainment.  Very nice monotone conversion too.  But my greatest pleasure came from realising that none of the five figures is visually or physically interacting with any other.  It''s as if they are each quite unaware of the presence of all the others.  It''s odd and weirdly pleasing that five people engaged on a common task would be arrayed in this disconnected way in a photograph. 8.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240158, 921844, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s either crap or brilliant. Second look ... a looooong one: yes I will go with brilliant, or close to it.  The feather (if it is a feather, or even if it isn''t) is the clincher.  Top ten.  Thank you.</td>', 'It''s either crap or brilliant. Second look ... a looooong one: yes I will go with brilliant, or close to it.  The feather (if it is a feather, or even if it isn''t) is the clincher.  Top ten.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240160, 921876, 30364, '<td valign="top">I think you are <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">melethia</a>.  If you aren''t I have just paid you a profound compliment.  It''s a beautifully judged photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'I think you are  melethia.  If you aren''t I have just paid you a profound compliment.  It''s a beautifully judged photograph.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240161, 921577, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh, I''m torn.  Picture is decent.  Title is<i> very</i> good indeed and makes me think the picture may be even better than I thought.  Top ten.  Thank you.</td>', 'Oh, I''m torn.  Picture is decent.  Title is very good indeed and makes me think the picture may be even better than I thought.  Top ten.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240163, 921757, 30364, '<td valign="top">Scale.  It''s all about scale I suppose.  Immensity of the stage versus insignificance of the person.  And the tiny bit of blur about the head &amp; shoulders, as a bit of a nod to posthumous.   Nevertheless I give it high marks for the conventional stuff:  perfect exposure and tonal control. Top ten for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Scale.  It''s all about scale I suppose.  Immensity of the stage versus insignificance of the person.  And the tiny bit of blur about the head & shoulders, as a bit of a nod to posthumous.   Nevertheless I give it high marks for the conventional stuff:  perfect exposure and tonal control. Top ten for me.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240164, 920872, 50864, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Oddly, I can''t tell if this is Don or a portrait for the posthumous challenge. Either way one of the best portraits I have seen and it gets better every time I look at it. 8</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Oddly, I can''t tell if this is Don or a portrait for the posthumous challenge. Either way one of the best portraits I have seen and it gets better every time I look at it. 8', '2010-12-01 10:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240166, 921921, 30364, '<td valign="top">This might be even better than I think, and I think it''s pretty good. I''m having a guess that you are <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53814" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pointandshoot</a>, and that''s the best compliment I can offer.  Top five for me.</td>', 'This might be even better than I think, and I think it''s pretty good. I''m having a guess that you are  pointandshoot, and that''s the best compliment I can offer.  Top five for me.', '2010-12-01 10:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240167, 921107, 30364, '<td valign="top">My immediate thought was of Henri Cartier-Bresson''s <a href="//photohistory.jeffcurto.com/archives/83" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hyères</a> photograph.  That''s a damn good first thought to inspire!!  Top five for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'My immediate thought was of Henri Cartier-Bresson''s Hyères photograph.  That''s a damn good first thought to inspire!!  Top five for me.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240171, 921804, 30364, '<td valign="top">If I were posthumous I would give you a ribbon for this.  Red, I think.  I like the illusion of looking down at his reflected alter ego.  Alas, I don''t think you are eligible to receive a posthumous ribbon.  Just a feeling I have.</td>', 'If I were posthumous I would give you a ribbon for this.  Red, I think.  I like the illusion of looking down at his reflected alter ego.  Alas, I don''t think you are eligible to receive a posthumous ribbon.  Just a feeling I have.', '2010-12-01 10:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240172, 921976, 30364, '<td valign="top">They look like a happy couple, strapped into seats 67A and 67B (well they both seem to be in 67A just at the moment) and headed on holiday to somewhere fun.  It''s improbably convincing and engaging.  Top three for me.</td>', 'They look like a happy couple, strapped into seats 67A and 67B (well they both seem to be in 67A just at the moment) and headed on holiday to somewhere fun.  It''s improbably convincing and engaging.  Top three for me.', '2010-12-01 10:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240173, 921107, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great capture and beautifully processed.</td>', 'Great capture and beautifully processed.', '2010-12-01 10:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240175, 921513, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m going with this as my top pick of the challenge, and I think it just may be by someone who has never won a posthumous ribbon.  Which would make it all the more pleasing for me.  I will be disappointed with Don if he does not reward you for this.<br/> <br/>Second visit.  Well I lie; it''s probably my fifth or so.  Nothing''s changed; it''s a spectacular and very instructive use of almost nothing to create an arresting photograph, and it''s still my top pick.  10.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''m going with this as my top pick of the challenge, and I think it just may be by someone who has never won a posthumous ribbon.  Which would make it all the more pleasing for me.  I will be disappointed with Don if he does not reward you for this. Second visit.  Well I lie; it''s probably my fifth or so.  Nothing''s changed; it''s a spectacular and very instructive use of almost nothing to create an arresting photograph, and it''s still my top pick.  10.  Thank you.', '2010-12-01 10:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240181, 921903, 50864, '<td valign="top">This gets better with each look. Love the processing (not quite black and white?) and perfect light streaming in. 8</td>', 'This gets better with each look. Love the processing (not quite black and white?) and perfect light streaming in. 8', '2010-12-01 10:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240191, 921880, 50864, '<td valign="top">Another one that I don''t know what to say since I''m not sure what I think but it is holding up very well over the week. I''ve moved it up several times so I must like it.  It will be so much fun to see the comments on shots like this. I am sure to learn a lot. love this challenge. 8</td>', 'Another one that I don''t know what to say since I''m not sure what I think but it is holding up very well over the week. I''ve moved it up several times so I must like it.  It will be so much fun to see the comments on shots like this. I am sure to learn a lot. love this challenge. 8', '2010-12-01 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240193, 921576, 50864, '<td valign="top">Fun picture to look at. I would like this hanging on my wall. 8</td>', 'Fun picture to look at. I would like this hanging on my wall. 8', '2010-12-01 10:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6240195, 921434, 50864, '<td valign="top">Wonderful candid street shot. Enjoy it very much.</td>', 'Wonderful candid street shot. Enjoy it very much.', '2010-12-01 10:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
