(6240263, 921932, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great black and white processing.  I like that so much of the dark is lost in the shadows. Beautiful angles in the windows.</td>', 'Great black and white processing.  I like that so much of the dark is lost in the shadows. Beautiful angles in the windows.', '2010-12-01 11:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
