(6241479, 921247, 54645, '<td valign="top">fabulous explosion of light and texture. I can imagine this is how Carlos Castaneda would experience a tree. My kind of image; energetic, full of life, makes me want to get up and go.</td>', 'fabulous explosion of light and texture. I can imagine this is how Carlos Castaneda would experience a tree. My kind of image; energetic, full of life, makes me want to get up and go.', '2010-12-02 01:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
