(6242131, 921976, 65035, '<td valign="top">The textures in this image have me coming back again and again it''s storybookish and a little dark, like the beginning of a dream when you''re not sure yet where it''s going...are those critters friend or foe...</td>', 'The textures in this image have me coming back again and again it''s storybookish and a little dark, like the beginning of a dream when you''re not sure yet where it''s going...are those critters friend or foe...', '2010-12-02 16:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
