(6242148, 921901, 65035, '<td valign="top">You have perfectly captured that moment of uncluttered pure happiness when the cares of the day have blown away with the wind and the nagging thoughts are drowned out by the sounds of the sea allowing room for laughter, freedom and peace.</td>', 'You have perfectly captured that moment of uncluttered pure happiness when the cares of the day have blown away with the wind and the nagging thoughts are drowned out by the sounds of the sea allowing room for laughter, freedom and peace.', '2010-12-02 16:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
