(6242159, 921730, 65035, '<td valign="top">Fascinating, it seems to me a lonely persons party of half remembered faces, snippets of good times rolling together...but I could be mistaken, it may be just a dream.</td>', 'Fascinating, it seems to me a lonely persons party of half remembered faces, snippets of good times rolling together...but I could be mistaken, it may be just a dream.', '2010-12-02 16:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
