(6242163, 921798, 65035, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel as though I''m struggling to wake up from a disturbing dream and failing, when I give up and accept it, it turns out to be peaceful. Very Clever.</td>', 'This makes me feel as though I''m struggling to wake up from a disturbing dream and failing, when I give up and accept it, it turns out to be peaceful. Very Clever.', '2010-12-02 16:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
