(6242184, 921034, 68504, '<td valign="top">Hard to get good offal these days.</td>', 'Hard to get good offal these days.', '2010-12-02 16:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242189, 921952, 65035, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the years of hushed snippets of conversation...<br/>"I''ve seen it"<br/>"You were probably drunk"<br/>"It''s true, old Bill saw it once years ago"<br/>"It''s a myth!"<br/>And here you are, you''ve not only seen this beautiful creature but taken a photo to prove your story. The believers will be in awe of you and the naysayers...they''ll naysay of course and no matter, you hold that moment in your memory.</td>', 'I can almost hear the years of hushed snippets of conversation..."I''ve seen it""You were probably drunk""It''s true, old Bill saw it once years ago""It''s a myth!"And here you are, you''ve not only seen this beautiful creature but taken a photo to prove your story. The believers will be in awe of you and the naysayers...they''ll naysay of course and no matter, you hold that moment in your memory.', '2010-12-02 17:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242194, 921902, 65035, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful geometry, so clean, so pristine, I find myself holding my breath so as not to not disturb anything.</td>', 'Such beautiful geometry, so clean, so pristine, I find myself holding my breath so as not to not disturb anything.', '2010-12-02 17:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242214, 921772, 68504, '<td valign="top">This catches me more each time I look at it. The only once of it, these elements just so, the boy''s clothes, the moonfaced doll, the buxom leather woman wtih glasses.</td>', 'This catches me more each time I look at it. The only once of it, these elements just so, the boy''s clothes, the moonfaced doll, the buxom leather woman wtih glasses.', '2010-12-02 17:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242222, 921976, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like your spotty mind, and the lovely couple, with the ducky picture (it is a ducky picture, right?) overseeing them. I would love to know what''s written at the bottom left. It is one of those images that stay in one''s mind for quite a while. (not voting)</td>', 'I like your spotty mind, and the lovely couple, with the ducky picture (it is a ducky picture, right?) overseeing them. I would love to know what''s written at the bottom left. It is one of those images that stay in one''s mind for quite a while. (not voting)', '2010-12-02 17:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242226, 921163, 68504, '<td valign="top">glissando</td>', 'glissando', '2010-12-02 17:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242231, 921107, 61396, '<td valign="top">Great homage to HC Bresson''s <a href="//www.sfmoma.org/view/assets/images/exhibitions/2010/cartier_bresson_hyeres_1932.jpg?w=366&amp;h=230&amp;scale=fit&amp;smileaction=image" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">staircase image</a> (I would consider waiting a little for the figure to show at the bottom of the stairs, but that''s just me). <br/> <br/>Came back to notice the effect created if you scroll the image up and down quickly. You should try it. It is Cool. (still not voting)</td>', 'Great homage to HC Bresson''s staircase image (I would consider waiting a little for the figure to show at the bottom of the stairs, but that''s just me).  Came back to notice the effect created if you scroll the image up and down quickly. You should try it. It is Cool. (still not voting)', '2010-12-02 17:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242235, 921816, 61396, '<td valign="top">or "into the abyss" (if you stare for a while like I did). (not voting)</td>', 'or "into the abyss" (if you stare for a while like I did). (not voting)', '2010-12-02 17:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242236, 921973, 68504, '<td valign="top">She looks sad.  Is that possible, or does she simply rest in a state of detached contemplation?  Strong photo.</td>', 'She looks sad.  Is that possible, or does she simply rest in a state of detached contemplation?  Strong photo.', '2010-12-02 17:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242237, 921974, 68504, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful, even perfect.</td>', 'Just wonderful, even perfect.', '2010-12-02 17:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242238, 921577, 61396, '<td valign="top">I can sense four faceless people in this claustrophobic scene, as it is hard to ignore the photographer presence. (not voting)</td>', 'I can sense four faceless people in this claustrophobic scene, as it is hard to ignore the photographer presence. (not voting)', '2010-12-02 17:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242239, 921485, 68504, '<td valign="top">What all don''t I feel in this play of homo ludens vs homo faber, light vs dark, wet vs dry, engagement vs indifference?  I want to reach in and pluck this moment.</td>', 'What all don''t I feel in this play of homo ludens vs homo faber, light vs dark, wet vs dry, engagement vs indifference?  I want to reach in and pluck this moment.', '2010-12-02 17:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242240, 921903, 68504, '<td valign="top">Such beautiful lines, obscured and ennobled by the progress of woman.</td>', 'Such beautiful lines, obscured and ennobled by the progress of woman.', '2010-12-02 17:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242241, 921570, 68504, '<td valign="top">Can''t decide if I want to eat it or take it home to bed with me.</td>', 'Can''t decide if I want to eat it or take it home to bed with me.', '2010-12-02 17:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242242, 921273, 68504, '<td valign="top">so wonderfully immediate.  I''m there.</td>', 'so wonderfully immediate.  I''m there.', '2010-12-02 17:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
