(6242267, 921362, 108069, '<td valign="top">Great lines, great color. The number and arrangement of birds is hard to believe. Quite a scene. The two lone fliers give it a nice balance and some motion. Cool shot.</td>', 'Great lines, great color. The number and arrangement of birds is hard to believe. Quite a scene. The two lone fliers give it a nice balance and some motion. Cool shot.', '2010-12-02 17:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
