(6242925, 921107, 104809, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and details.  Wonderful spiral shape and movement blur.  I was so engrossed in the curve, that I almost entirely missed the wall texture in the lower-right until the moment I''m typing this comment.  One of my faves this challenge.  8</td>', 'I love the texture and details.  Wonderful spiral shape and movement blur.  I was so engrossed in the curve, that I almost entirely missed the wall texture in the lower-right until the moment I''m typing this comment.  One of my faves this challenge.  8', '2010-12-02 23:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
