(6242931, 921958, 104809, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I''m distracted a little by the processing.  For my eye, it was sharpened a little too much.  This results in a bit of aliasing in high-contrast details, particularly the top edge of the bumper.  I didn''t like what it did to the texture of the trees, either, but that could certainly be a matter of personal taste.  Despite this minor shortcoming, I do like the subject you found and captured.  Giving it a 6.</td>', 'I like this, but I''m distracted a little by the processing.  For my eye, it was sharpened a little too much.  This results in a bit of aliasing in high-contrast details, particularly the top edge of the bumper.  I didn''t like what it did to the texture of the trees, either, but that could certainly be a matter of personal taste.  Despite this minor shortcoming, I do like the subject you found and captured.  Giving it a 6.', '2010-12-02 23:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
