(6242935, 921513, 104809, '<td valign="top">I''ve never really been inspired to guess at who the photographer was before now, but this whispers to me.  Will have to see if I''m right after voting is complete.  I like the simplicity of this, along with the textures.  7</td>', 'I''ve never really been inspired to guess at who the photographer was before now, but this whispers to me.  Will have to see if I''m right after voting is complete.  I like the simplicity of this, along with the textures.  7', '2010-12-02 23:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6242936, 921912, 104809, '<td valign="top">Your lunar cauldron is very cool.  I think I would have been tempted to crop the trees at the bottom out.  In a challenge where it''s not a crime to go blurry, I still wonder how this would have looked with more clarity/detail in the clouds.  Quite enjoyable, despite my overthinking.  7</td>', 'Your lunar cauldron is very cool.  I think I would have been tempted to crop the trees at the bottom out.  In a challenge where it''s not a crime to go blurry, I still wonder how this would have looked with more clarity/detail in the clouds.  Quite enjoyable, despite my overthinking.  7', '2010-12-02 23:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
