(6243100, 921919, 41337, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> you dumbass my comment was high praise! this was top 10 for me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wanted tears from you. I tried to give you some but it didn''t work out so well. &lt;insert jokes here&gt;<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-03 01:23:21.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: you dumbass my comment was high praise! this was top 10 for me.   I wanted tears from you. I tried to give you some but it didn''t work out so well. <insert jokes here>', '2010-12-03 01:23:13.000000', '2010-12-03 01:23:21.000000', 0),
