(6243118, 921892, 30861, '<td valign="top">Very nice finish, Are, in a very strong challenge. You and I are the only ones in the top 20 that are not either B/W or predominantly monochromatic in color range. Who''da thought a Norwegian would be so colorful? jejeje/</td>', 'Very nice finish, Are, in a very strong challenge. You and I are the only ones in the top 20 that are not either B/W or predominantly monochromatic in color range. Who''da thought a Norwegian would be so colorful? jejeje/', '2010-12-03 01:58:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243119, 921558, 30861, '<td valign="top">I love that line, "Removed some ducks." :-) I hope you ate them? Nice finish, lovely shot.</td>', 'I love that line, "Removed some ducks." :-) I hope you ate them? Nice finish, lovely shot.', '2010-12-03 01:59:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243120, 921836, 30861, '<td valign="top">Birdsong and flashings! Well seen. Congrats on top-20.</td>', 'Birdsong and flashings! Well seen. Congrats on top-20.', '2010-12-03 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243126, 921934, 30861, '<td valign="top">Dang, you DO work hard, don''t you? I''m glad you finished so well with what, to many, must have seemed a determinedly non-posthumous type of image. I''m glad to see the man himself appreciated the result :-) As always, with your work, well done. <br/> <br/>FWIW, remove the ten 1-votes altogether and you have 170 votes averaging 6.6235, for a 6th-place finish :-)</td>', 'Dang, you DO work hard, don''t you? I''m glad you finished so well with what, to many, must have seemed a determinedly non-posthumous type of image. I''m glad to see the man himself appreciated the result :-) As always, with your work, well done.  FWIW, remove the ten 1-votes altogether and you have 170 votes averaging 6.6235, for a 6th-place finish :-)', '2010-12-03 02:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243129, 921730, 74588, '<td valign="top">so-much-for-the-reality show<br/>big-bummer<br/></td>', 'so-much-for-the-reality showbig-bummer', '2010-12-03 02:15:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243130, 921939, 41337, '<td valign="top">When I first saw your photograph I had similar thoughts as Louis. It''s interesting because had the person been something else like an inanimate object, I probably wouldn''t have objected to the contrived nature. <br/> <br/>ETA: That said, upon second viewing I do find myself appreciating it more. The concept, the sense of scale both literally and figuratively, the juxtaposition and the style of rendering do play a compelling tune. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-12-03 02:27:48.</i></td>', 'When I first saw your photograph I had similar thoughts as Louis. It''s interesting because had the person been something else like an inanimate object, I probably wouldn''t have objected to the contrived nature.  ETA: That said, upon second viewing I do find myself appreciating it more. The concept, the sense of scale both literally and figuratively, the juxtaposition and the style of rendering do play a compelling tune. ', '2010-12-03 02:21:54.000000', '2010-12-03 02:27:48.000000', 0),
(6243132, 921362, 18655, '<td valign="top">Congrats with a well deserved ribbon Robert. I also love the B/W''s but still nice to see a splash of color in the top 10.</td>', 'Congrats with a well deserved ribbon Robert. I also love the B/W''s but still nice to see a splash of color in the top 10.', '2010-12-03 02:25:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243136, 921956, 66384, '<td valign="top">Kelli, I didn''t leave a comment, because I had no idea what to say -- I just gave it a good score. Now thanks to Don and Robert, I can say CONGRATULATIONS!</td>', 'Kelli, I didn''t leave a comment, because I had no idea what to say -- I just gave it a good score. Now thanks to Don and Robert, I can say CONGRATULATIONS!', '2010-12-03 02:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243140, 921580, 66384, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this -- I gave it a 10. I find it very disturbing, perhaps a depiction of deep depression or thoughts of suicide. Not something I want on my wall, but something that will definitely stay with me.</td>', 'I can''t believe I didn''t comment on this -- I gave it a 10. I find it very disturbing, perhaps a depiction of deep depression or thoughts of suicide. Not something I want on my wall, but something that will definitely stay with me.', '2010-12-03 02:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
