(6243152, 921107, 30214, '<td valign="top">congrats with the high finish, however still feels underrated to me. The resemblance to the iconic HCB image is uncanny.</td>', 'congrats with the high finish, however still feels underrated to me. The resemblance to the iconic HCB image is uncanny.', '2010-12-03 03:16:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243153, 921981, 49109, '<td valign="top">Way underrated. Now that I see it again, some blur and b/w might have helped for a higher finish :)</td>', 'Way underrated. Now that I see it again, some blur and b/w might have helped for a higher finish :)', '2010-12-03 03:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243154, 920814, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hrmmmm. To be honest, I thought the Dennis Heckman image was the Skewsme image, during the voting phase. Turns out this one is the "real" Skewsme, which would be fine except I want to believe the actual Skewsme is a feline Skewsme and this would seem to have been created by a vulpine Skewsme. But heck, I know nothing, and I never seem to learn. Better I appreciate, I think, and this is appreciable. Nice work :-)</td>', 'Hrmmmm. To be honest, I thought the Dennis Heckman image was the Skewsme image, during the voting phase. Turns out this one is the "real" Skewsme, which would be fine except I want to believe the actual Skewsme is a feline Skewsme and this would seem to have been created by a vulpine Skewsme. But heck, I know nothing, and I never seem to learn. Better I appreciate, I think, and this is appreciable. Nice work :-)', '2010-12-03 03:17:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243156, 921876, 30214, '<td valign="top">and you were "depressed"?! I wish I had a finish like that in this challenge. Congrats Deb! Great shot!</td>', 'and you were "depressed"?! I wish I had a finish like that in this challenge. Congrats Deb! Great shot!', '2010-12-03 03:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243158, 921804, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> snapshot or badly composed? Only thing in focus is the top of the chair, contrast is too high, your foot is in the frame; posthumous will probably call it art. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It was all worth it just for that imperishable comment from Captain Obvious.  Congrats! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I love you, too, Bromide Surfer!</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: Originally posted by h2: snapshot or badly composed? Only thing in focus is the top of the chair, contrast is too high, your foot is in the frame; posthumous will probably call it art.   It was all worth it just for that imperishable comment from Captain Obvious.  Congrats!   I love you, too, Bromide Surfer!', '2010-12-03 03:19:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243159, 921903, 30214, '<td valign="top">top ten and a place in the PH gallery! congrats, Johanna, loved your shot.</td>', 'top ten and a place in the PH gallery! congrats, Johanna, loved your shot.', '2010-12-03 03:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243161, 921362, 48228, '<td valign="top">AWESOME RESULT and so DESERVED...love from shez</td>', 'AWESOME RESULT and so DESERVED...love from shez', '2010-12-03 03:40:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243163, 920887, 99392, '<td valign="top">Too bad this one didn''t do better. I was one of your 9s. I don''t think I''ve ever seen a hummingbird shot quite like this.  What could be a colorful and joyful picture, is transformed into a melancholy and somber memory, frozen yet fading away.  This effort was a bold (and successful) attempt at turning something ordinary into a piece of art.  Fav.</td>', 'Too bad this one didn''t do better. I was one of your 9s. I don''t think I''ve ever seen a hummingbird shot quite like this.  What could be a colorful and joyful picture, is transformed into a melancholy and somber memory, frozen yet fading away.  This effort was a bold (and successful) attempt at turning something ordinary into a piece of art.  Fav.', '2010-12-03 03:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6243169, 921424, 96751, '<td valign="top">You are deconstructing into oblivion...</td>', 'You are deconstructing into oblivion...', '2010-12-03 04:03:20.000000', NULL, 0),
