(6243173, 921919, 96751, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i>  "2010  A Strange Odyssey", the truncated monolith,<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=762723" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_762723.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OMG!  You''re right.<br/> <br/>Awesome image.  Congrats on your paw and your PH gallery!</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music:  "2010  A Strange Odyssey", the truncated monolith,   OMG!  You''re right. Awesome image.  Congrats on your paw and your PH gallery!', '2010-12-03 04:08:09.000000', NULL, 0),
