(6243289, 921919, 65319, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh...so this gaggle of geese is YOUR image!  <br/> <br/>Gosh...straight into the PH gallery AND a PAW from Puppy Bear...<br/> <br/>Richard?!  Are you turning into a...<br/> <br/>::gasp::<br/> <br/>RIBBON HOG?!!!!  <br/> <br/>::promptly faints::</td>', 'Ahhhh...so this gaggle of geese is YOUR image!   Gosh...straight into the PH gallery AND a PAW from Puppy Bear... Richard?!  Are you turning into a... ::gasp:: RIBBON HOG?!!!!   ::promptly faints::', '2010-12-03 08:09:06.000000', NULL, 0),
