(6243301, 921577, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  I''m surprised there isn''t more grain with the camera used and the high ISO.  Congrats.</td>', 'Nicely done.  I''m surprised there isn''t more grain with the camera used and the high ISO.  Congrats.', '2010-12-03 08:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
