(6243542, 921804, 38032, '<td valign="top">So looking over the images today I never did the obvious thing and see what the actual <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> shot was  until now.<br/> <br/>Looking at this with more time and patience, I actaully find it to be much more engaging than i originally thought:<br/>likes: <br/>-The striped shirts remind me of childhood-  as if this image was taken of me and a friend<br/>-the chairs have a nice way of framing this<br/>-As I mentioned in my previous comment, the leg approaching adds intrigue<br/>-The extreme lines and persepective are obviously the main drama here<br/> <br/>dislike:<br/>that thing hanging on the back of the chair =) <br/> <br/>Thanks for the posthumous ribbons and in the inspiration and creativity it helps encourage.  Getting a ribbon in this category is on par with one in a free study- except cooler! =)</td>', 'So looking over the images today I never did the obvious thing and see what the actual  posthumous shot was  until now. Looking at this with more time and patience, I actaully find it to be much more engaging than i originally thought:likes: -The striped shirts remind me of childhood-  as if this image was taken of me and a friend-the chairs have a nice way of framing this-As I mentioned in my previous comment, the leg approaching adds intrigue-The extreme lines and persepective are obviously the main drama here dislike:that thing hanging on the back of the chair =)  Thanks for the posthumous ribbons and in the inspiration and creativity it helps encourage.  Getting a ribbon in this category is on par with one in a free study- except cooler! =)', '2010-12-03 12:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
