(6243618, 921366, 96751, '<td valign="top">This may be the most haunting image in the challenge.  There is something very terrifying about it to me, as though he''s being sucked up by the dark forces he''s conjured with his own missteps.  It has stayed with me long after first viewing it.  There is such angst.  Amazing.</td>', 'This may be the most haunting image in the challenge.  There is something very terrifying about it to me, as though he''s being sucked up by the dark forces he''s conjured with his own missteps.  It has stayed with me long after first viewing it.  There is such angst.  Amazing.', '2010-12-03 13:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
