(6243645, 921424, 30861, '<td valign="top">Got to admire the heck out of anyone who shoots pinhole with a 5DmkII, LOL. Can I swap bodies with you? I doubt you can tell the difference for these shots...<br/> <br/>Oh, yeah, it''s beautiful. I had it narrowed down to a Leslie, a ZZ, or a Ben during voting.</td>', 'Got to admire the heck out of anyone who shoots pinhole with a 5DmkII, LOL. Can I swap bodies with you? I doubt you can tell the difference for these shots... Oh, yeah, it''s beautiful. I had it narrowed down to a Leslie, a ZZ, or a Ben during voting.', '2010-12-03 14:06:38.000000', NULL, 0),
