(6243689, 921903, 65319, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this image...immediately a dazzling array of lines, shadows, and polygonal shapes struck me with full force.  Upon further contemplation, the textures and tonality bring out an artistically arranged image and I very much like the tilt!  My only nattering naybob nitpick is actually the person''s clothes which (to my eye) undermines the classy aspect of this image.  Well, that''s my two cents...congrats on Top 10, Johanna!</td>', 'When I first saw this image...immediately a dazzling array of lines, shadows, and polygonal shapes struck me with full force.  Upon further contemplation, the textures and tonality bring out an artistically arranged image and I very much like the tilt!  My only nattering naybob nitpick is actually the person''s clothes which (to my eye) undermines the classy aspect of this image.  Well, that''s my two cents...congrats on Top 10, Johanna!', '2010-12-03 15:18:34.000000', NULL, 0),
