(6245206, 921513, 21714, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pointandshoot:</b></div><hr/><i> congratulations Az, this is a remarkable work of art. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>You have inspired me a lot with many of your images. If there aren''t people like you around I don''t think I would have even wanted to make an attempt. <br/> <br/>Thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by pointandshoot: congratulations Az, this is a remarkable work of art.  You have inspired me a lot with many of your images. If there aren''t people like you around I don''t think I would have even wanted to make an attempt.  Thank you.', '2010-12-05 14:02:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245264, 921934, 54446, '<td valign="top">This is a "10" in my book, but not for this challenge.  Beautiful image.  One of my favs overall.  But, it really DNMC.</td>', 'This is a "10" in my book, but not for this challenge.  Beautiful image.  One of my favs overall.  But, it really DNMC.', '2010-12-05 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245374, 921939, 50695, '<td valign="top">What I love about it is the outrageous shapes and contrasts that just don''t seem to fit the perspective we''re expecting to see. Elements seem to float, or belong to other worlds. "contrivedness" is not so bad when it''s taken over the top. As I told Paul, you both surprised me in this challenge.</td>', 'What I love about it is the outrageous shapes and contrasts that just don''t seem to fit the perspective we''re expecting to see. Elements seem to float, or belong to other worlds. "contrivedness" is not so bad when it''s taken over the top. As I told Paul, you both surprised me in this challenge.', '2010-12-05 19:40:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245381, 921034, 50695, '<td valign="top">"Wonder how many will figure out that they''re staring at entrails...."<br/> <br/>your title was a serious clue.</td>', '"Wonder how many will figure out that they''re staring at entrails...." your title was a serious clue.', '2010-12-05 19:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245382, 921424, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought that was a Donovan song...</td>', 'Originally posted by ubique: First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.  I thought that was a Donovan song...', '2010-12-05 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245385, 921439, 50695, '<td valign="top">rule of art: what you want is never as good as what you might find<br/> <br/>I saw a story about a family in this shot. That''s what took it over the top for me.</td>', 'rule of art: what you want is never as good as what you might find I saw a story about a family in this shot. That''s what took it over the top for me.', '2010-12-05 19:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245434, 921902, 122591, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the wonderful comments!<br/> <br/>This was a very fun challenge to shoot for as well as to vote in, and I am truly honored to place top-ten among such amazing pictures! The score is a personal best for me as well, which makes it twice as exciting :)</td>', 'Thank you all for the wonderful comments! This was a very fun challenge to shoot for as well as to vote in, and I am truly honored to place top-ten among such amazing pictures! The score is a personal best for me as well, which makes it twice as exciting :)', '2010-12-05 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
