(6245699, 921884, 53814, '<td valign="top">I like this different, iconic view of the homeless. We don''t need to see his face to know the wrapper from his last meal never found a trash bin, or that he made the money for that meal by begging from customers while they were filling their gas tanks. He is just another faceless statue, a frozen reminder of our insensitivity. <br/>The thin blanket isn''t much protection from an unexpected cold snap in Alabama. Maybe at least one fellow human offered him a warm jacket. <br/>Nice work.<br/></td>', 'I like this different, iconic view of the homeless. We don''t need to see his face to know the wrapper from his last meal never found a trash bin, or that he made the money for that meal by begging from customers while they were filling their gas tanks. He is just another faceless statue, a frozen reminder of our insensitivity. The thin blanket isn''t much protection from an unexpected cold snap in Alabama. Maybe at least one fellow human offered him a warm jacket. Nice work.', '2010-12-06 00:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6245718, 921424, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ubique:</b></div><hr/><i> First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought that was a Donovan song... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well it was, but it was a buddhist saw before that.  That Donovan was just a leech.</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: Originally posted by ubique: First I liked the image, then I didn''t like it, then I did. Like the old zen paradox about a mountain.  I thought that was a Donovan song...   Well it was, but it was a buddhist saw before that.  That Donovan was just a leech.', '2010-12-06 00:43:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6246051, 921889, 120666, '<td valign="top">Wow Congratulations of the Posthumous Blue Posthumous Ribbon Scott! I stared at this image a long time, I had a feeling it was on the conceptual target, but I have a long way to go before I actually know stuff.</td>', 'Wow Congratulations of the Posthumous Blue Posthumous Ribbon Scott! I stared at this image a long time, I had a feeling it was on the conceptual target, but I have a long way to go before I actually know stuff.', '2010-12-06 10:46:34.000000', NULL, 0),
